      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I am still waiting to get my system installed. Initially it was going to take 2 weeks, but with the recent rains, I expected it to get pushed out. I was telephoned by the office girl to say installation would be on Monday 29/11/10, on the Friday 26/11/10, I was telephoned by the installer himself to say installation was now to be Friday 3/12/10 7.30am so I arranged to take the day off work. The office girl rang Thursday(2/11) to say they would be here at 9.00am Friday as they had to finish off a job. On the Friday I rang their office at 10.45 to ask where they were. The office girl rang back to say they would be here soon. At 2.00pm I had another call from the office girl apologising that they will not be able to make it at all. I asked if they will be here Mon 6/12/10, still waiting, they were to ring me back.",
